<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38811" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηετᾰνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span> (v.
		infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>abundant, ample,
				sufficient</i> (<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέχουσιν ἐπηετανὸν γάλα θῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.89
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρασιαὶ . . ἐπηετανὸν
			γανόωσαι</span> (as Adv.) <i><span class="en">
				7.128
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτον . . ἐ. παρέχοιμι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.360
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλυνοὶ ἐ.</span> troughs
				<i>always full,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				6.86
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13.247
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ οὐ κομιδὴ κατὰ νῆα ἦεν
					ἐπηετανός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.233
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηετανὸν γὰρ ἔχεσκον</span>
			for they had <i>great store,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				7.99
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.427
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				6.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηεταναὶ τρίχες</span>
			<i>thick, full</i> fleeces, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				517
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀμαζόνες] ἐπηετανὸν κομέουσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.1176
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηεταναὶ πλατάνιστοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.20
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				280
			</span></i>. [In <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				113
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				607
			</span></i>, quadrisyll.]</div>
